# Keeps the Cloud Build source upload small and fast. Without this file the
# deploy uploads and rebuilds against the entire repo including .venv/ (630MB
# local virtualenv) — that's what caused a live deploy to hit
# DEADLINE_EXCEEDED after ~2900 dots of "Building Container...." Verified by
# checking `du -sh .venv` (630M) against the total repo size (631M) after the
# failure, not assumed.
.git/
.gitignore
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
*.log
dist/
build/
.env
